# Override of the image's bpfloader.rc, bind-mounted at runtime (the image is
# not modified). A rootless container cannot load kernel BPF programs, and the
# stock service reboots Android when bpfloader fails. Same approach as Valve's
# Lepton: keep the service defined but never start it; waydroid.prop sets
# bpf.progs_loaded=1 so netd does not wait for it.
on load_bpf_programs
    write /proc/sys/net/core/bpf_jit_enable 1

service bpfloader /system/bin/bpfloader
    oneshot
    disabled
